      </li>
      </ul>
      <h2 id="configuring-localqueue-for-admission-fair-sharing_admission-fair-sharing" class="group scroll-mt-20">Configuring a local queue for admission fair sharing (optional)<a href="#configuring-localqueue-for-admission-fair-sharing_admission-fair-sharing" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
      <p class="_abstract">Optionally, you can configure <code>fairSharing</code> section in your <code>LocalQueue</code> object to adjust its weight in the fair sharing calculation. The higher the weight, the lower the penalty. For example, specifying a weight of <code>2</code> treats the queue as if it is used by half as many resources.</p>
      <p><strong>Procedure</strong></p>
      <ul>
      <li>
      Specify a <code>weight</code> value as shown in the following example:
      <CodeBlock code={"apiVersion: kueue.x-k8s.io/v1beta2\nkind: LocalQueue\nmetadata:\n  name: team-a-queue\n  namespace: team-a\nspec:\n  clusterQueue: shared-queue\n  fairSharing:\n    weight: \"2\"  # This queue will be treated as if it used half as many resources"} lang="yaml" />
